[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784773534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105131#issuecomment-2784773534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105131","id":2784773534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l_EWe","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T22:29:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T22:29:39Z","body":"Could you test to see if this bug happens in Godot 4.4 stable and 4.3 stable? Also, could you test if reverting the driver to a previous version fixes the bug?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784773534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787088768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105131#issuecomment-2787088768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105131","id":2787088768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mH5mA","user":{"login":"neomonkey","id":5145163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDUxNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5145163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey","html_url":"https://github.com/neomonkey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T16:51:34Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T16:51:34Z","body":"I changed the Compability mode back to Forward+ and I tried to reproduce backtracking things that I did yesterday ( no luck ). I loaded the 4.4 and 4.3 stable versions ready to be used, so when it happens again I can start debugging it. But because it was so random when it started, it's hard to think what might have caused it. But I come forward when I can reproduce it or if it doesn't happen after few weeks of usage.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787088768/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790920940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105131#issuecomment-2790920940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105131","id":2790920940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mWhLs","user":{"login":"neomonkey","id":5145163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDUxNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5145163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey","html_url":"https://github.com/neomonkey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T20:24:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T11:14:46Z","body":"Okay now it occured again. So here is the test so far.\n\nGODOT 4.4.1-stable - BUG occurs. (Forward+)\nGODOT 4.4-stable - BUG occurs. (Forward+)\nGODOT 4.3-stable - BUG doesn't occure. (Forward+)\nGODOT 4.4.1-stable - BUG occurs. (compatible) (UPDATE)\nChanging AMD Driver -> Not tested.\n\nBelow there is a video about this lag happening with fresh GODOT 4.4-stable even with the first minutes of the start. Now I noticed some pattern. As you can see from the video, the main window works pretty well, but this occurs with popup windows (Debug window included) and when I hover my mouse over buttons or scrollbars. This might not be the cause, but it starts lagging before the button or scrollbar highlights, if I don't highlight for a while, it normalizes until new button highlights.\n\nDescription of the video (sorry Github turns it automatically landscape and messes the beginning):\n1. I opened \"Import Existing project.\" -> No Lag.\n2. Opens FilePick window and starts lagging (mouse cursor teleports when I try to move it)\n3. When I close the Filepicker with cancel, there is another popup window, which also lags.\n4. When I close all popups, the lag ends immidiadly.\n-> Same thing happened with Font editor popup.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52352556-fda9-4ce2-b4bb-81df6fc6d47c\n\nHope this helps, I'll continue to work with GODOT 4.3-stable and see if the bug occurs on longer use.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790920940/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799040609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105131#issuecomment-2799040609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105131","id":2799040609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m1fhh","user":{"login":"neomonkey","id":5145163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDUxNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5145163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey","html_url":"https://github.com/neomonkey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T21:11:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T22:23:03Z","body":"Okay so no errors in GODOT 4.3.\n\nBUT\n\nI switched back to GODOT 4.4.1. Now I noticed that the break happened with the new tooltip system. I started working with my project and after a while, a GODOT NODE editor tooltip opening took a long time. After a while another tooltip took a long time. Then I noticed the error message below. Now after that the UI started lagging. I rebooted GODOD and INSTANTLY same errors when I tried to check tooltips.\n\nSo I think this problem is with the new tooltip system introduced in GODOT 4.4. With the video post this happened with new popup windows, so it can also be that.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9082ad36-fe26-4bcd-bf54-e2ff8967bb72)\n\nIn the end, this limits the time I can work with Godot, because after a while it always breaks the editor pretty useless. So I need to change back to 4.3 because the need to reboot after around 20mins of work.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799040609/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799898565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105131#issuecomment-2799898565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105131","id":2799898565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m4w_F","user":{"login":"neomonkey","id":5145163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDUxNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5145163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey","html_url":"https://github.com/neomonkey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T10:35:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T11:14:06Z","body":"New update on this bug.\n\nI measured how much this affects my GPU/ CPU and memory. Answer is none. I measured this with AMD tools and windows own tools, so although my mouse starts lagging, it doesn't use resources from my PC. It just lags.\n\nToday the lagging started again after 30 minutes, but this time when I went to my filetree and tried to create a new folder with mouse right click. When the menu popped up, the Errors started to push into output window and mouse started lagging. When I closed the right mouse menu, it stopped instantly. Rebooting Godot didn't help, but rebootin computer did.\n\nEarlier post I said that changing the forward+ to compatible mode helped. But now I can confirm it doesn't help.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799898565/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150620596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105131#issuecomment-3150620596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105131","id":3150620596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67yqe0","user":{"login":"neomonkey","id":5145163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDUxNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5145163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey","html_url":"https://github.com/neomonkey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neomonkey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T13:03:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T13:03:18Z","body":"Change to AMD Driver 25.6.1 fixed this issue, this issue doesn't happen anymore.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150620596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156838034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105131#issuecomment-3156838034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105131","id":3156838034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68KYaS","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T22:36:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T22:36:47Z","body":"Closing per the above comment. Please comment if you can still reproduce this on the latest Godot *and* AMD driver versions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3156838034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]